#. おぉ、苗木誠殿！　奇遇ではありませんか！
msgctxt "0001 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Ah, Mr. Naegi! Funny meeting you here!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな苗木誠殿に敬礼！
msgctxt "0002 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "A salute to you!"
msgstr ""

#. 敬礼！　敬礼が出ましたよ！
#. 山田必殺の敬礼が出ましたねー、これ！！
msgctxt "0003 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Salute! I just saluted, did ya see!? That was the\n"
"Hifumi Ultimate Salute! Zam!"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Hifumi"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうしよう？
#. こんな山田クンと一緒に過ごせるかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Do I want to hang out with Hifumi?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 最近のレイヤーは歴史を知らなさ過ぎる！
#. コスプレの意義と成り立ちを！
msgctxt "0007 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Cosplayers these days are totally ignorant of the\n"
"origin, the history, the significance of their hobby!"
msgstr ""

#. 歴史を知らないと、
#. 痛い目を見るのは自分だって言うのに…
msgctxt "0008 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"And if you don't know your history, you can never have\n"
"a complete cosplay experience!"
msgstr ""

#. ですから、苗木誠殿には、
#. しっかりと歴史を学んでもらいますぞ！
msgctxt "0009 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"So, Mr. Naegi, prepare for a gloriously detailed\n"
"history of the cosplay world. Now, in 1955..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンのマニアックな話を、
#. 一方的に聞かせられた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I listened to Hifumi's half-obsessed ranting for way\n"
"too long...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hifumi and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Hifumi a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
